# What a local `docker build` sees: the code, plus what Cloud Build would copy in
# from the EU buckets (dictionary/, model/, judge_reference.json). Everything
# else stays out of the image: the data, the outputs, the labels.
*
!pyproject.toml
!karimi/
!karimi_normalise/
!deploy/
!dictionary/
!model/
!judge_reference.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
